lists SouthernSanDoriaS/Rongelouts_N_Distaud/onTrigger SouthernSanDoriaS/onEventFinish/165 XarcabardS/onZoneIn/1 XarcabardS/Backfilled_Pit/onTrigger XarcabardS/Compact_Footprint/onTrigger XarcabardS/Sunken_Footprint/onTrigger BatalliaDownsS/onZoneIn/1 BatalliaDownsS/Fresh_Snowmelt/onTrigger BatalliaDownsS/Menechme/onMobDeath BatalliaDownsS/onEventFinish/116 BatalliaDownsS/onEventFinish/117
